      "id": "claim_f6d4118cd3734a999c722276049b04e6",
      "statement": "Profile source intake accepts only UTF-8 `.json`, `.md`, and `.txt` regular files; folder ingestion recurses in lexical order, while symlinks, out-of-root entries, nonregular files, and documents over 2,000,000 bytes are rejected.",
