    {
      "id": "claim_54030b6bf24844f5bed5768695a21bee",
      "statement": "Profile ingestion is batch-idempotent: the input mode and normalized facts determine an `ib_...` batch ID, an existing batch replays with zero changes, and new compatible batches insert only missing fact values and nonduplicate claims before deriving the profile revision and state.",
