      "id": "claim_8b77c4e27d1c41b29206365ade81d76e",
      "statement": "The profile export is deterministic and atomically replaced as an owner-only file; a repeated CLI ingestion restores a tampered `profile.json` from authoritative SQLite even when the ingestion itself has zero changes.",
